From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:58:05 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] lynx-screen

The Lynx picture is 160x102 in the middle of its 240x160 canvas. Actual
shows it at 4x, 640x408 in the middle of the 720x480 panel, the only
system where 4x fits: Platform::actual_scale gives Lynx a 180x120
window of the canvas (the fork's numbers), every other system keeps its
Actual rect. Stretch fills the panel with the 160x102 picture. Actual
is the default in Config/picture.txt and there is no Crop (no
overscan).
---
